OL,3,ADramatic eviction of woman aged 87
OL,4,Ahighlights Spain's housing shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dramatic eviction of an 87-year-old
OL,7,Fwoman from the home in Madrid where she
OL,8,Flived for seven decades has drawn
OL,9,Fattention to the depth of Spain's
OL,10,Fhousing crisis.
OL,12,FThe tenant of the flat in the Retiro
OL,13,Farea of central Madrid, Maricarmen, was
OL,14,Funable to pay the rent set by the
OL,15,Finvestment firm that owns it.
OL,17,FMaricarmen's father first rented the
OL,18,Fproperty in 1956 and she continued as
OL,19,Fthe tenant after her parents died,
OL,20,Fduring which time there was a cap on
OL,21,Fthe rent.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
