OL,4,Ahighlights Spain's housing shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the company that bought the
OL,7,Fproperty in 2018, Urbagestion, cited a
OL,8,Flegal glitch allowing it to raise her
OL,9,Frent from bB,500 (#428; $572) to
OL,10,FbB,2,650.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
